  "title": "Sustained RR alternation does not establish incremental AF-detection value after temporal, spectral and ordinal controls",
  "abstract": "In AFDB-to-LTAFDB external exploratory evaluation, sustained RR alternation coverage changed equal-record log loss by 0.00287213; the source-refit/target-record bootstrap95% interval [-0.00759, 0.01564] does not establish incremental benefit. Existing-public-data analysis:2687 source windows/25recordings and17623 target windows/83eligible recordings. Exploratory external evaluation, not untouched confirmation. AI-authored; author checks are not peer review.",
